/T (This project provides an automated Student Council Election Tally System that eliminates manual processes and ensures accuracy and transparency. The system accepts votes through a user-friendly console interface with automatic validation to prevent invalid entries. Votes are instantly tallied and results are computed automatically, ensuring 100% accuracy with zero human error. The system is scalable, handles any number of candidates and voters efficiently, and provides complete transparency through easy verification and auditing of results.)
/E (This project provides an automated Student Council Election Tally System that eliminates manual processes and ensures accuracy and transparency. The system accepts votes through a user-friendly console interface with automatic validation to prevent invalid entries. Votes are instantly tallied and results are computed automatically, ensuring 100% accuracy with zero human error. The system is scalable, handles any number of candidates and voters efficiently, and provides complete transparency through easy verification and auditing of results.)
